# One line. Run from the repo root by `orgasmic verify TASK-MRJRK`.
#
# Both halves of the defect, against a snapshot whose board carries a project
# its `projects` map does not — the state constructed directly, because what
# produced it on the operator's daemon is still open and the diagnosis was
# never allowed to wait on that.
#
# The filter catches exactly the two tests that answer the two operator
# questions: what does the 404 say, and can the condition be seen without
# provoking a 404 at all.
env -u ORGASMIC_RUN_ID -u ORGASMIC_HOME cargo test -p orgasmic-daemon --lib index_snapshot
